The second entering edge carries its own literal: parked from `drafting`, the run comes back to
`drafting`. A hook value cannot be computed from the transition, so the source status is static per
edge and the recorded value differs by which edge was taken.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  tracker:
    driver: cli
-- fixtures/cwd/run/index.md --
---
title: "Demo"
status: drafting
return_to: null
---

# Demo
